# Cross-origin isolation: lets onnxruntime-web's threaded wasm backend use
# SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded inference) in the OCR and translate
# workers. Every cross-origin subresource must opt in — all bundled assets
# are same-origin, and the runtime model/wasm fetches (Hugging Face, jsDelivr)
# send CORS headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
